{% comment %}
  Search results — 搜索结果页主体（pages-ui §11 / SDD §4.1 #16）。

  2026-11-12 整页重写：原文件是 Skeleton 自带的 71 行裸结构（h1 + 一个 input +
  一个按钮 + 一个 200px auto-fill 网格），与全站版式完全脱节。现在的结构：

    面包屑 → 品牌色 hero（唯一 h1 + 结果数 + 大搜索条）
      → 类型标签（All / Products / Articles / Pages）
      → 商品结果（复用 snippets/product-card.liquid，网格断点对齐集合页）
      → 文章 / 页面结果（下方独立分组，行卡）
      → 圆形分页
    无结果 → 空态（提示 + 全部商品入口 + 热门集合）
    未搜索 → 起始态（提示 + 热门集合）

  复用与依据：
  - 商品卡走 product-card snippet + assets/product-card.css（该 CSS 文件头本来就写着
    "首页 / 集合页 / 搜索页共用"，此前搜索页一直没接上）。三件套脚本与集合页同款。
  - 断点（2 / 3 / 4 列，750 / 1280）、圆形分页、color-mix 配色全部对齐 collection.liquid。
  - 类型切换用**官方 `type` 查询参数**（逗号分隔 product/page/article，默认全部），
    激活态回读 `search.types`；纯 GET 链接、零 JS，URL 天然可分享。
    见 https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/navigation-search/search
  - 结果类型判别按官方示例：object_type 明确是 article / page 的进内容组，
    其余一律按商品处理（search.results 只可能是 product / article / page 三种）。

  明确的取舍（不要误当成遗漏）：
  - **本轮不做 `search.filters` 筛选，也不做排序下拉**。前者依赖 Search & Discovery
    后台配置 + faceted-filters.js 的 Section Rendering 改造，是 pages-ui §6.1 的独立工单；
    后者默认按 relevance 排序，对搜索结果是最合理的默认，加控件反而稀释重点。
    本轮的范围是"把骨架样式补齐"，结构已把结果区独立成 .search-page__results，
    后续接筛选时不用再动版式。
  - 热门集合读全局 `collections`（limit 4），不引入 collection 类型设置：
    主题包带不了集合，设置会诱导演示店写回 templates/search.json，打包前还得清。
    没有集合时整块不渲染（判 `collection.title != blank`，不判 `if collection`）。
{% endcomment %}

<script src="{{ 'wishlist-toggle.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'tilt-element.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{{ 'product-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign per_page = section.settings.results_per_page | default: 12
  # search.types 是本次搜索实际命中的类型数组。我们的标签只产生单类型 URL，
  # 所以「size == 1」即代表用户点了某个类型；不带 type 参数（或全类型）一律视为 All。
  assign active_type = ''
  if search.types.size == 1
    assign active_type = search.types.first
  endif
  assign encoded_terms = search.terms | url_encode
  assign all_results_url = routes.search_url | append: '?q=' | append: encoded_terms
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  热门集合入口在「未搜索」与「无结果」两处复用。先 capture 成字符串再判空，
  避免依赖 capture 内 assign 的作用域，也避免先输出标题才发现一个集合都没有。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture popular_markup -%}
  {%- for collection in collections limit: 4 -%}
    {%- if collection.title != blank -%}
      <li class="search-page__popular-item">
        <a class="search-page__popular-link" href="{{ collection.url }}">
          {%- if collection.image -%}
            {{
              collection.image
              | image_url: width: 96
              | image_tag:
                class: 'search-page__popular-image',
                widths: '96, 192',
                sizes: '48px',
                loading: 'lazy',
                alt: ''
            }}
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="search-page__popular-image search-page__popular-image--empty" aria-hidden="true">
              {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="search-page__popular-name">{{ collection.title | escape }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign popular_trimmed = popular_markup | strip -%}
{%- assign has_popular = false -%}
{%- if popular_trimmed != blank -%}
  {%- assign has_popular = true -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} 未执行搜索时 results_count 可能不是数字 0，用 has_results 统一判定 {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign has_results = false -%}
{%- if search.performed and search.results_count > 0 -%}
  {%- assign has_results = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div class="search-page">
  <nav class="search-page__breadcrumb" aria-label="{{ 'general.breadcrumb' | t }}">
    <ol class="search-page__breadcrumb-list" role="list">
      <li class="search-page__breadcrumb-item">
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_home' | t }}</a>
      </li>
      <li class="search-page__breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page">{{ 'search.title' | t }}</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="search-page__hero">
    <h1 class="search-page__title">{{ 'search.title' | t }}</h1>

    {%- if search.performed -%}
      {%- comment -%} 读屏播报用完整句；视觉行把关键词单独做成高亮 chip {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="visually-hidden" role="status">
        {{ 'search.results_for_html' | t: terms: search.terms, count: search.results_count }}
      </p>
      <p class="search-page__summary">
        {{ 'search.results_count' | t: count: search.results_count }}
        <span class="search-page__terms">“{{ search.terms | escape }}”</span>
      </p>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="search-page__summary">{{ 'search.intro' | t }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <form class="search-page__form" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search">
      <div class="search-page__field">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="SearchPageInput">{{ 'search.label' | t }}</label>
        <span class="search-page__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
        <input
          id="SearchPageInput"
          class="search-page__input"
          type="search"
          name="q"
          value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
          placeholder="{{ 'search.placeholder' | t | escape }}"
          autocomplete="off"
        >
        <button type="submit" class="search-page__submit btn-solid">{{ 'search.submit' | t }}</button>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} 重新搜索时保留当前类型，否则用户从「Articles」页再搜会静默跳回全部 {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if active_type != '' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="type" value="{{ active_type | escape }}">
      {%- endif -%}
    </form>
  </div>

  {%- if search.performed and search.results_count == 0 -%}
    {%- comment -%} ── 无结果 ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="search-page__empty">
      <span class="search-page__empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
      <h2 class="search-page__empty-title">{{ 'search.no_results_html' | t: terms: search.terms }}</h2>
      <p class="search-page__empty-body">{{ 'search.empty_body' | t }}</p>
      <ul class="search-page__tips" role="list">
        <li class="search-page__tip">{{ 'search.tip_spelling' | t }}</li>
        <li class="search-page__tip">{{ 'search.tip_shorter' | t }}</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="search-page__empty-cta btn-solid" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
        {{ 'search.browse_all' | t }}
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if search.performed and search.results_count > 0 -%}
    <nav class="search-page__types" aria-label="{{ 'search.type_label' | t }}">
      <ul class="search-page__types-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <a class="search-page__type" href="{{ all_results_url }}"{% if active_type == '' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            {{ 'search.type_all' | t }}
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="search-page__type" href="{{ all_results_url }}&amp;type=product"{% if active_type == 'product' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            {{ 'search.products' | t }}
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="search-page__type" href="{{ all_results_url }}&amp;type=article"{% if active_type == 'article' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            {{ 'search.articles' | t }}
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="search-page__type" href="{{ all_results_url }}&amp;type=page"{% if active_type == 'page' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            {{ 'search.pages' | t }}
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="search-page__results">
      {%- paginate search.results by per_page -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign product_count = 0
          assign content_count = 0
          for result in search.results
            if result.object_type == 'article' or result.object_type == 'page'
              assign content_count = content_count | plus: 1
            else
              assign product_count = product_count | plus: 1
            endif
          endfor
        -%}

        {%- if product_count > 0 -%}
          <section class="search-page__group" aria-labelledby="SearchProductsHeading">
            <div class="search-page__group-head">
              <h2 class="search-page__group-title" id="SearchProductsHeading">{{ 'search.products' | t }}</h2>
              <span class="search-page__group-count">{{ product_count }}</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="search-page__grid" role="list">
              {%- for result in search.results -%}
                {%- if result.object_type != 'article' and result.object_type != 'page' -%}
                  <li class="search-page__grid-item">
                    {%- liquid
                      assign card_lazy = true
                      if forloop.index <= 4
                        assign card_lazy = false
                      endif
                    -%}
                    {% render 'product-card',
                      product: result,
                      lazy: card_lazy,
                      quick_add: section.settings.show_quick_add,
                      show_width: section.settings.show_specs,
                      show_cc: false,
                      show_power: section.settings.show_specs,
                      show_weight: false,
                      sizes: '(min-width: 1280px) 19vw, (min-width: 750px) 25vw, 45vw'
                    %}
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </section>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if content_count > 0 -%}
          <section class="search-page__group" aria-labelledby="SearchContentHeading">
            <div class="search-page__group-head">
              <h2 class="search-page__group-title" id="SearchContentHeading">{{ 'search.content_heading' | t }}</h2>
              <span class="search-page__group-count">{{ content_count }}</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="search-page__content-list" role="list">
              {%- for result in search.results -%}
                {%- if result.object_type == 'article' or result.object_type == 'page' -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign result_image = result.image | default: result.featured_image
                    if result.object_type == 'article'
                      assign result_type_label = 'search.type_article' | t
                    else
                      assign result_type_label = 'search.type_page' | t
                    endif
                  -%}
                  <li class="search-page__content-item">
                    <a class="search-page__content-link" href="{{ result.url }}">
                      {%- if result_image -%}
                        {{
                          result_image
                          | image_url: width: 240
                          | image_tag:
                            class: 'search-page__content-image',
                            widths: '120, 240',
                            sizes: '88px',
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            alt: ''
                        }}
                      {%- else -%}
                        <span class="search-page__content-image search-page__content-image--empty" aria-hidden="true">
                          {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <span class="search-page__content-text">
                        <span class="search-page__content-type">{{ result_type_label }}</span>
                        <span class="search-page__content-title">{{ result.title | highlight: search.terms }}</span>
                        {%- if result.content != blank -%}
                          <span class="search-page__content-excerpt">
                            {{- result.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 | highlight: search.terms -}}
                          </span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </section>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%} 与集合页同款：走 paginate.parts 自定义结构，不用 default_pagination（输出无法控形） {%- endcomment -%}
          <nav class="search-page__pagination" aria-label="{{ 'search.pagination_label' | t }}">
            {%- if paginate.previous -%}
              <a class="search-page__pagination-nav" href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}" aria-label="{{ 'search.pagination_previous' | t }}">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
              </a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="search-page__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- for part in paginate.parts -%}
              {%- if part.is_link -%}
                <a class="search-page__pagination-page" href="{{ part.url }}" aria-label="{{ 'search.page_number' | t: number: part.title }}">{{ part.title }}</a>
              {%- elsif part.title == paginate.current_page -%}
                <span class="search-page__pagination-page" aria-current="page">{{ part.title }}</span>
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="search-page__pagination-gap" aria-hidden="true">{{ part.title }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}

            {%- if paginate.next -%}
              <a class="search-page__pagination-nav" href="{{ paginate.next.url }}" aria-label="{{ 'search.pagination_next' | t }}">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
              </a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="search-page__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </nav>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endpaginate -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 热门集合：未搜索 / 无结果两种状态都给一条不依赖搜索词的退路 {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if has_popular and has_results == false -%}
    <section class="search-page__popular" aria-labelledby="SearchPopularHeading">
      <h2 class="search-page__popular-title" id="SearchPopularHeading">{{ 'search.popular_heading' | t }}</h2>
      <ul class="search-page__popular-list" role="list">{{ popular_markup }}</ul>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ===================================================================
     Search results — 页面骨架
     配色纪律（AGENTS §6 / css-variables.liquid）：所有色值从
     --color-background / --color-foreground / --color-brand* 派生，
     不写 rgb(0 0 0 / x) / rgb(255 255 255 / x)，Noir 预设自动适配。
     =================================================================== */
  .search-page {
    padding-block: 1.5rem clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  /* 面包屑：与集合页同款发丝线 + 斜杠分隔 */
  .search-page__breadcrumb {
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }
  .search-page__breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .search-page__breadcrumb-item + .search-page__breadcrumb-item::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-inline-end: 0.5rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__breadcrumb-item a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .search-page__breadcrumb-item a:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Hero：品牌色浅染卡片。右上角一层极淡的径向光，避免大块平涂发闷。 */
  .search-page__hero {
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 16%, transparent);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        120% 160% at 100% 0%,
        color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 10%, transparent),
        transparent 62%
      ),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 4%, var(--color-background));
  }
  .search-page__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .search-page__summary {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .search-page__terms {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* 搜索条：白底胶囊 + 左侧放大镜 + 右侧品牌实心按钮。
     flex item 自身带 min-inline-size: 0，否则长关键词会把整条撑出视口
     （AGENTS §5 的横向溢出教训，加在祖先上无效）。 */
  .search-page__field {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    max-inline-size: 48rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.35rem 0.35rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .search-page__field:focus-within {
    border-color: var(--color-brand);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 18%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__icon svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }
  .search-page__input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border: 0;
    outline: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .search-page__input::placeholder {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 45%, transparent);
  }
  /* 隐藏 WebKit 自带的清除叉：它与右侧提交按钮挤在一起，且无法定制 */
  .search-page__input::-webkit-search-cancel-button {
    display: none;
  }
  .search-page__submit {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* 类型标签：胶囊，当前项品牌绿实心。44px 触摸目标。 */
  .search-page__types {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .search-page__types-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .search-page__type {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .search-page__type:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .search-page__type[aria-current='page'] {
    border-color: transparent;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    /* 用背景色作前景色：Noir 下品牌是亮 lime，白字压上去不达 AA */
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* 分组头 */
  .search-page__group + .search-page__group {
    margin-block-start: 2.75rem;
  }
  .search-page__group-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding-block-end: 0.75rem;
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__group-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .search-page__group-count {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* 商品网格：minmax(0, 1fr) 从源头掐断 min-content 传导（不是靠 overflow 裁） */
  .search-page__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .search-page__grid-item {
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .search-page__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .search-page__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  /* 文章 / 页面行卡：缩略图 + 类型标签 + 标题 + 两行摘要。
     整卡可点、不额外放行尾箭头（同屏箭头总数要克制，见 AGENTS §6）。 */
  .search-page__content-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  /* 宽屏两列：单列会被拉到 1300px+，一段两行摘要横在中间很难读 */
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .search-page__content-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .search-page__content-link {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .search-page__content-link:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 40%, transparent);
    box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
    transform: translateY(var(--card-hover-lift));
  }
  .search-page__content-image {
    width: 88px;
    /* image_tag 会输出 width/height HTML 属性，那个 height 是 presentational hint；
       不显式覆盖就会压掉 aspect-ratio，图被拉成素材的原生比例。 */
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 4%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__content-image--empty {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 55%, transparent);
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__content-image--empty svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }
  .search-page__content-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .search-page__content-type {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .search-page__content-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .search-page__content-excerpt {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  /* highlight filter 输出 <strong class="highlight">，不自带样式 */
  .search-page__content-title .highlight,
  .search-page__content-excerpt .highlight {
    padding-inline: 0.1em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 14%, transparent);
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* 分页：与集合页同款白圆按钮，当前页品牌绿实心 */
  .search-page__pagination {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
  }
  .search-page__pagination-nav,
  .search-page__pagination-page {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .search-page__pagination a:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 40%, transparent);
  }
  .search-page__pagination [aria-disabled='true'] {
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
  .search-page__pagination [aria-current='page'] {
    border-color: transparent;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .search-page__pagination-gap {
    min-width: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 45%, transparent);
  }

  /* 空态：比集合页的虚线框更进一步，给可执行的下一步 */
  .search-page__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    max-inline-size: 52rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.75rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem) 1.25rem;
    /* 20% 发丝虚线在白底上几乎看不见，改用一层品牌淡底把空态收成一张卡 */
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 18%, transparent);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 3%, var(--color-background));
    text-align: center;
  }
  .search-page__empty-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin-block-end: 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .search-page__empty-icon svg {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
  }
  .search-page__empty-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .search-page__empty-body {
    max-inline-size: 46ch;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .search-page__tips {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .search-page__tip::before {
    content: '·';
    margin-inline-end: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .search-page__empty-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-block-start: 0.85rem;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* 热门集合 / 起始态入口 */
  .search-page__popular {
    margin-block-start: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  }
  .search-page__popular-title {
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .search-page__popular-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .search-page__popular-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .search-page__popular-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    min-height: 64px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .search-page__popular-link:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 40%, transparent);
    box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
    transform: translateY(var(--card-hover-lift));
  }
  .search-page__popular-image {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .search-page__popular-image--empty {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .search-page__popular-image--empty svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }
  .search-page__popular-name {
    min-inline-size: 0;
    /* break-word 只在单词本身超宽时才断，不像 anywhere 会把 Chainsaws 拆成两段 */
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  /* 窄栏：搜索条改圆角矩形，给按钮和输入留足空间，胶囊不会挤成球 */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .search-page__field {
      padding-inline-start: 0.75rem;
      border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    }
    .search-page__submit {
      padding-inline: 1rem;
    }
    /* 四个类型标签收进一行：默认 padding 下 Pages 会单独掉到第二行 */
    .search-page__types-list {
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .search-page__type {
      padding-inline: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
    .search-page__content-link {
      grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .search-page__content-image {
      width: 64px;
    }
    /* 两列入口每列只有 ~150px：图标与内边距都收一档，把宽度还给文字 */
    .search-page__popular-list {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .search-page__popular-link {
      gap: 0.45rem;
      padding: 0.55rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .search-page__popular-image {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }
  }

  .search-page a:focus-visible,
  .search-page button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .search-page__field,
    .search-page__type,
    .search-page__content-link,
    .search-page__popular-link {
      transition: none;
    }
    .search-page__content-link:hover,
    .search-page__popular-link:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.search",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "results_per_page",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 12,
      "label": "t:sections.search.settings.results_per_page",
      "info": "t:sections.search.settings.results_per_page_info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_quick_add",
      "default": true,
      "label": "t:sections.search.settings.show_quick_add"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_specs",
      "default": true,
      "label": "t:sections.search.settings.show_specs",
      "info": "t:sections.search.settings.show_specs_info"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "t:general.search" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
